# Google Drive upload — OAuth user (works with personal Gmail My Drive)
# 1) Enable Google Drive API
# 2) Create OAuth client (Desktop) → secrets/gdrive-oauth-client.json
# 3) Create a Drive folder; put its ID below (from the folder URL)
# 4) First upload opens a browser to authorize; token saved to secrets/gdrive-oauth-token.json
GDRIVE_FOLDER_ID=
GDRIVE_OAUTH_CLIENT=secrets/gdrive-oauth-client.json
GDRIVE_OAUTH_TOKEN=secrets/gdrive-oauth-token.json

# Service account only works with Workspace Shared Drives (not personal My Drive):
# GOOGLE_APPLICATION_CREDENTIALS=secrets/gdrive-service-account.json
